  "prefLabel": "Puc 407.01 Form T-4 Transfer of Customer Base Report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 407.01 Form T-4 Transfer of Customer Base Report. In connection with any transfer of customer base in which the acquiring carrier is a telephone utility, the acquiring carrier shall file a copy with the commission and the department the \"Transfer of Customer Base Report\" form pursuant to En 404.10. The “Transfer of Customer Base Report” shall include:\n\n(a) Utility filing information for the selling or transferring company;\n\n(b) Utility filing information for the acquiring company;\n\n(c) The number of New Hampshire customers affected;\n\n(d) The effective date of the transfer; and\n\n(e) An attached the department’s form En Form T-1 “Contact and Trade Name Information”, for the acquiring company, if the acquiring company is a telephone utility, as specified in En 408.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 409.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc400.html"
